#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/cluster/high_availability.rst:5
msgid ""
"Deploy primary and secondary supervisors, workers, a shared database and a unified "
"Nginx entry. This guide assumes containers with Xinference and the Enterprise HA "
"script already installed."
msgstr "部署主備 supervisor、worker、共享資料庫及統一 Nginx 入口。本指南假設容器中已安裝 Xinference 和企業版高可用指令碼。"

